<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1TH" style="id">RRK53.SFM Runyankore-Rukiga Bible Version 1964 lasted edited 06.07.2022</book>
  <para style="h">1 ABATESALONIKA</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ebaruha y'okubanza ei Paulo yaahandiikiire Abatesalonika</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 Abatesalonika</para>
  <para style="toc3">1 Tes</para>
  <para style="mt2">EBARUHA Y'OKUBANZA EI PAULO YAAHANDIIKIIRE</para>
  <para style="mt1">ABATESALONIKA</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1TH 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 1:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 17:1">Byak 17:1</ref>. </char>
    </note> Paulo na Siluwaano na Timoseo twabahandiikira imwe ab'ekanisa y'aba Tesalonika, abari omuri Ruhanga Isheboona na Mukama waitu Yesu Kristo; nitubendeza embabazi n'obusingye.<verse eid="1TH 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Paulo okubasiima ahabw'ebyana by'engiri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 1:2" />Ebiro byona tusiima Ruhanga ahabwanyu mwena, nitugamba aha maziina gaanyu omu kushaba kwaitu, <verse eid="1TH 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 1:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 1:4">Kol 1:4</ref>, <ref loc="COL 1:5">5</ref>. </char></note> nitwijuka obutoosha omu maisho ga Ruhanga Tataitwe emirimo yaanyu erikuruga omu kwikiriza, n'okukora okurikuruga omu kukunda, n'okugumisiriza okurikuruga omu matsiko agu mwine omuri Mukama waitu Yesu Kristo. <verse eid="1TH 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 1:4" />B'eishe-emwe abarikukundwa Ruhanga, nitumanya ku yaabatooraine, <verse eid="1TH 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 1:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 2:5">1 Kor 2:5</ref>. </char></note> ahakuba engiri yaitu terabaiziire mu bigambo byonka, kureka omu maani n'omu Mwoyo Orikwera n'omu kwikiririza kimwe mutarikubanganisa. Naimwe nimumanya oku twabaire turi omuriimwe ahabw'okubahwera; <verse eid="1TH 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 1:6" />kandi obu mwayakiira ekigambo omu busaasi bwingi mwine okushemererwa okurikuruga omu Mwoyo Orikwera, mukatooreza emitwarize yaitu n'eya Mukama; <verse eid="1TH 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 1:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1PE 5:3">1 Pet 5:3</ref>. </char></note> n'ahabw'ekyo mukahinduka eky'okureeberaho aha barikwikiriza boona ab'omuri Makedonia na Akaya. <verse eid="1TH 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 1:8" />Ahakuba ekigambo kya Mukama nimwo kyarugire nikigambwa, ti muri Makedonia na Akaya zonka, kureka hoonahoona okwikiriza Ruhanga kwanyu kurangainwe; n'ahabw'ekyo titwine kindi eki tushemereire kubigambaho. <verse eid="1TH 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 1:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 12:2">1 Kor 12:2</ref>. </char></note> Ahakuba nabo bonka nibagamba ebyaitu, oku mwatwakiire, n'oku mwarekire ebishushani ebirikuramibwa, mukahindukira Ruhanga, okuheereza Ruhanga ogwo ohuriire, ow'amazima, <verse eid="1TH 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 1:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="TIT 2:13">Tit 2:13</ref>. </char></note> n'okutegyereza Omwana we kuruga omu iguru, ou yaazoire omu bafu, Yesu otujuna ekiniga ekirikwenda kwija.<verse eid="1TH 1:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1TH 2" />
  <para style="s1">Emitwarize ya Paulo omuribo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 2:1" />Ahakuba naimwe, B'eishe-emwe, nimumanya ngu okubataayaayira kwaitu tikurabaire kwa busha; <verse eid="1TH 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 2:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 16:20-24">Byak 16:20-24</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 17:1-5">17:1-5</ref>. </char></note> kwonka, n'obu turaabe twabonabonesiibwe tukahemangurwa munonga omuri Filipi, nk'oku murikumanya, tukagira obumanzi omuri Ruhanga waitu kubabuurira engiri ye omu kuhakanisibwa kwingi. <verse eid="1TH 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 2:3" />Mumanye ngu okubuurira kwaitu ti kw'okuhabya, ti kw'ebihagaro, kandi tikurimu bugobya; <verse eid="1TH 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 2:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 1:10">Gal 1:10</ref>. </char></note> kureka, nk'oku twasiimirwe Ruhanga kukwatsibwa engiri, nikwo tugamba, ti habw'okushemeza bantu, kureka okushemeza Ruhanga ocaaka emitima yaitu. <verse eid="1TH 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 2:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 20:33">Byak 20:33</ref>; <ref loc="2PE 2:3">2 Pet 2:3</ref>. </char></note> Nimumanya ngu titukakoresaga bigambo by'okushunga, n'obu byakuba eby'okushwekyerera okwetenga okubi, Ruhanga niwe kareebi; <verse eid="1TH 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 2:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 5:41">Yoh 5:41</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 5:44">44</ref>. </char></note> kandi titukendaga bantu kutuha ekitiinisa, yaaba imwe, nari abandi, n'obu turaabe twabaire tushemereire kubarusya nk'entumwa za Kristo. <verse eid="1TH 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 2:7" />Kwonka tukatwaza gye omuriimwe, nk'oku omurezi arera abaana be. <verse eid="1TH 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 2:8" />N'ahabw'ekyo, ahabw'okubasaasibwa munonga, tukashemerererwa okubaha, ti ngiri ya Ruhanga yonka, kureka n'okuhayo amagara gaitu, ahabw'okuba mukahinduka abaitu ab'aha mara.<verse eid="1TH 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 2:9" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:9: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1CO 4:12">1 Kor 4:12</ref>. </char>
    </note> B'eshe-emwe, nimwijuka okukora kwaitu n'okufa kubi kwaitu; tukaba tukora nyomushana na nyekiro, ngu tutagira ou twarusya omuriimwe, nitubabuurira engiri ya Ruhanga. <verse eid="1TH 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 2:10" />Imwe muri baakareebi, hamwe na Ruhanga, abarikuhamya emitwarize yaitu ahariimwe abarikwikiriza, ku yaabaire eri erikwera, ey'okuhikiirira, kandi etarikugaywa; <verse eid="1TH 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TH 2:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 20:31">Byak 20:31</ref>. </char></note> ahakuba nimumanya oku twabaire twehanangiriza omuntu weena omuriimwe nitubagumya, kandi nitubaragiira, nk'oku omushaija ahana abaana be, <verse eid="1TH 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TH 2:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2TH 1:5">2 Tes 1:5</ref>. </char></note> ngu mutwaze nk'oku kishemereire aba Ruhanga orikubeeta kutaaha omu bukama bwe n'ekitinisa kye.<verse eid="1TH 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TH 2:13" />Kandi hoona eki tusiimira Ruhanga obutoosha n'eki; ahakuba, ku mwahuriire ekigambo ky'engiri ya Ruhanga eki twabagambiire, mwakyakiira; kandi timwakyakiira nk'ekigambo ky'abantu, kureka nk'ekigambo kya Ruhanga ekirikukora omuriimwe abarikwikiriza; kandi omu mazima nikwo kiri. <verse eid="1TH 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TH 2:14" />Kandi, B'eishe-emwe, mukakuratira amakanisa ga Ruhanga aga Buyudaaya agari omuri Kristo Yesu; ahakuba ebi mwabonabonesiibwe beene waanyu bikashusha nk'ebi ab'ago makanisa baabonabonesiibwe Abayudaaya, <verse eid="1TH 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TH 2:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 7:52">Byak 7:52</ref>. </char></note> abaitsire Mukama waitu Yesu na baanabi, naitwe bakatubinga, bakagwisa kubi Ruhanga, bakaba abazigu b'abantu boona, <verse eid="1TH 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TH 2:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 23:32">Mat 23:32</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 23:33">33</ref>. </char></note> nibatuzibira kubuurira Abanyamahanga eby'okujunwa, ngu babone kuhikiiriza batyo obutoosha orugyero rw'ebibi byabo. Kwonka ekiniga kya Ruhanga kiizire kubamariraho kimwe.<verse eid="1TH 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Paulo okubagirira orushusho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TH 2:17" />Kwonka itwe, B'eishe-emwe, ku twabaihirweho okumara omwanya mukye, omu mubiri ti mu mutima, twayeyongyera munonga kugira orushusho rw'okwenda kureebana naimwe; <verse eid="1TH 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TH 2:18" />ahakuba tukamariirira kwija owaanyu, nangwa nyowe Paulo nkenda kwija, ti rimwe ni kabiri; kwonka Sitaane yaatuzibira. <verse eid="1TH 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TH 2:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PHP 4:1">Fil 4:1</ref>. </char></note> Mbwenu amatsiko gaitu niki, nari okushemererwa kwaitu nari ekirunga kyaitu eky'okwesiimiraho? Tiimwe, omu maisho ga Mukama waitu Yesu ku ariija? <verse eid="1TH 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TH 2:20" />Ahakuba niimwe kitiinisa kyaitu n'okushemererwa kwaitu.<verse eid="1TH 2:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1TH 3" />
  <para style="s1">Okushemererwa kw'Omukristaayo omu busaasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 3:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 17:14">Byak 17:14</ref>, <ref loc="ACT 17:15">15</ref>. </char>
    </note> N'ahabw'ekyo, ku twaremirwe kugumisiriza, twasiima kutsigara twenka omuri Aseene, <verse eid="1TH 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 3:2" />twatuma ow'eishe-emwe Timoseo, omuheereza wa Ruhanga omu ngiri ya Kristo, kubagumya n'okubeezirikisa omu kwikiriza kwanyu, <verse eid="1TH 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 3:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2TH 1:4">2 Tes 1:4</ref>. </char></note> ngu hatagira owaashoberwa ahabw'okubonabonesibwa okwo. Naimwe ahabwanyu nimumanya ku nikyo twateereirweho. <verse eid="1TH 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 3:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 14:22">Byak 14:22</ref>. </char></note> Ahakuba tukabamanyisa kare tukiri owaanyu, ku turi ab'okubonabonesibwa; kandi nikwo kyabaire, nk'oku murikumanya. <verse eid="1TH 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 3:5" />N'ahabw'ekyo, ku naaremirwe kugumisiriza, naabatumaho kumanya okwikiriza kwanyu oku kuri, twine obwoba, ngu shana obundi omutegi akaaba yaabategire, naitwe okukora kwaitu kufa busha.<verse eid="1TH 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 3:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:6: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 18:5">Byak 18:5</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kwonka mbwenu Timoseo ku aizire naaruga okwo, yaatureetera amakuru marungi ag'okwikiriza kwanyu n'okukunda kwanyu, kandi ngu nimutwijuka obutoosha n'embabazi, mutwiniire orushusho, nkaitwe oku turubainiire. <verse eid="1TH 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 3:7" />N'ahabw'ekyo, B'eishe-emwe, tuhuumwire ahabwanyu omu kushoberwa n'omu kubonabona kwaitu ahabw'okwikiriza kwanyu; <verse eid="1TH 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 3:8" />mbwenu hati turiyo gye, ahabw'okuba mwemereire muhamiire omuri Mukama. <verse eid="1TH 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 3:9" />Ni kusiima ki oku turaabasiimire Ruhanga ahabw'okushemererwa kwona oku twine ahabwanyu omu maisho ga Ruhanga waitu, <verse eid="1TH 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 3:10" />tukashaba n'obweziriki nyomushana na nyekiro, ngu tureebane, kandi tuhikiirize ekibuzire omu kwikiriza kwanyu?<verse eid="1TH 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TH 3:11" />Mbwenu Ruhanga Tataitwe ahabwe na Mukama waitu Yesu atuhe oburyo bw'okwija owaanyu; <verse eid="1TH 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TH 3:12" />Mukama abongyere kandi abakanyisize okukunda oku murikukundana, kandi oku murikukunda abantu boona, nk'oku turikubakunda imwe, <verse eid="1TH 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TH 3:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PHP 1:10">Fil 1:10</ref>; <ref loc="2TH 1:10">2 Tes 1:10</ref>. </char></note> abone kuhamya emitima yaanyu, eshangwe etaine ki erikugaywa omu kwera omu maisho ga Ruhanga Tataitwe aha kiro ky'okwija kwa Mukama waitu Yesu n'abarikwera be boona.<verse eid="1TH 3:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1TH 4" />
  <para style="s1">Eby'Obushwere oburikwera</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 4:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2TH 3:6">2 Tes 3:6</ref>. </char>
    </note> Eky'aha muheru, B'eishe-emwe, nitubeeshengyereza omuri Mukama waitu Yesu, kandi nitubeehanangiriza ngu, nk'oku mwayegire ahariitwe oku mushemereire kutwaza n'okushemeza Ruhanga, kandi nk'oku murikukora hati, mugume mweyongyere mutyo n'okukiraho. <verse eid="1TH 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 4:2" />Ahakuba nimumanya ebiragiro ebi twabahaire omu iziina rya Mukama waitu Yesu. <verse eid="1TH 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 4:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1TH 5:23">1 Tes 5:23</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 10:10">Heb 10:10</ref>. </char></note> Mumanye ngu eki nikyo Ruhanga arikubendeza, okwezibwa, mukeerinda obushambani, <verse eid="1TH 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 4:4" />omuntu weena omuriimwe amanye <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nari: okushwera omukazi omu kwera n'omu kitiinisa. </char></note>kutegyeka omubiri gwe omu kwera n'omu kitiinisa, <verse eid="1TH 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 4:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 1:24-32">Rom 1:24-32</ref>. </char></note> ti mu mururu gw'okurigira okubi nk'abanyamahanga abatarikumanya Ruhanga, <verse eid="1TH 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 4:6" />omuntu weena arekye kushiisha akashaagiza mugyenzi we omu kigambo ekyo, ahakuba Mukama niwe muhoozi w'enzigu ow'ebyo byona, nk'oku twabaire twabahabwire nitubahamiiriza. <verse eid="1TH 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 4:7" />Ahakuba Ruhanga taratweteire kukora bihagaro, kureka akatwetera okuba abarikwera. <verse eid="1TH 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 4:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 10:16">Luk 10:16</ref>. </char></note> N'ahabw'ekyo omuntu orikugaya ebyo, naaba atagayire muntu kureka Ruhanga obaha Omwoyo we Orikwera.<verse eid="1TH 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Eby'okukundana kw'ab'eishe-emwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 4:9" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:9: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 13:34">Yoh 13:34</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kwonka ebirikukwata aha kukundana kw'ab'eishe-emwe, timuri b'okubihandiikirwa; ahabw'okuba imwe ahabwanyu mukeegyesibwa Ruhanga okukundana; <verse eid="1TH 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 4:10" />kandi buzima nimukunda ab'eishe-emwe boona ab'omuri Makedonia yoona. Kwonka nitubeehanangiriza, B'eishe-emwe, mugume mweyongyere kukundana, <verse eid="1TH 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TH 4:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2TH 3:12">2 Tes 3:12</ref>. </char></note> mwezirikire okucureera, mukore emirimo yaanyu, kandi mukorese emikono yaanyu, nk'oku twabaragiire, <verse eid="1TH 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TH 4:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 4:5">Kol 4:5</ref>. </char></note> mugire emicwe mirungi aha b'aheeru, kandi murekye kutungwa eby'abandi.<verse eid="1TH 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Eby'okugaruka kwa Mukama waitu Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TH 4:13" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:13: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EPH 2:12">Efe 2:12</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kwonka, B'eishe-emwe, titwakwenzire ngu mutamanya eby'abo abagwejegyeire, murekye kuganya nk'abandi abataine matsiko. <verse eid="1TH 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TH 4:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 15:12-19">1 Kor 15:12-19</ref>. </char></note> Ahakuba ku turaabe nitwikiriza ngu Yesu akafa yaazooka, n'abaagwejegyereire omuri Yesu nikwo Ruhanga aribareeta atyo hamwe nawe. <verse eid="1TH 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TH 4:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 15:51">1 Kor 15:51</ref>, <ref loc="1CO 15:52">52</ref>. </char></note> Kandi nitubagambira eki, tukigambiirwe Mukama waitu, ngu itwe abahuriire abarishangwa bakiriho aha kiro ky'okwija kwa Mukama, tituribandiza abo abaagwejegyeire. <verse eid="1TH 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TH 4:16" />Ahakuba Mukama aryayeimukira ashuume naaruga omu iguru agambe munonga n'eiraka rya maraika omukuru n'enzamba ya Ruhanga; kandi abaafeereire omuri Kristo nibo baribanza kuzooka; <verse eid="1TH 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TH 4:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 17:24">Yoh 17:24</ref>. </char></note> bwanyima naitwe abahuriire abariba bakiriho turyatwarwa nabo omu bicu kubugana Mukama waitu omu kaabunga; tutyo tugume na Mukama ebiro byona. <verse eid="1TH 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TH 4:18" />N'ahabw'ekyo muhuumurizane n'ebigambo ebyo.<verse eid="1TH 4:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1TH 5" />
  <para style="s1">Okweteekateekyera okugaruka kwa Kristo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 5:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:1-2: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 24:36">Mat 24:36</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 24:42-44">42-44</ref>; <ref loc="REV 3:3">Kush 3:3</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kwonka aha by'ebiro n'obunaku, B'eishe-emwe, timuri b'okuhandiikirwa; <verse eid="1TH 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 5:2" />ahabw'okuba imwe ahabwanyu nimumanya gye ngu ekiro kya Mukama kiryaija nk'omushuma wa nyekiro. <verse eid="1TH 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 5:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 6:14">Yer 6:14</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 24:30">Mat 24:30</ref>. </char></note> Ku bariba nibagira ngu, n'obusingye, tihariho kabi, obwo nibwo okucwekyerera kuribagwaho, nk'oku ebisha bikwata omukazi orikurumwa kuzaara, kandi tibarikira na kakye. <verse eid="1TH 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 5:4" />Kwonka imwe, B'eishe-emwe, timuri omu mwirima, ekiro ekyo kubagwaho nk'omushuma; <verse eid="1TH 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 5:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 13:12">Rom 13:12</ref>; <ref loc="EPH 5:9">Efe 5:9</ref>. </char></note> ahabw'okuba imwe mwena muri abaana b'omushana, kandi abaana ba nyomushana; itwe tituri ba nyekiro n'obu baakuba ab'omwirima. <verse eid="1TH 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 5:6" />N'ahabw'ekyo turekye kugwejegyera nk'abandi; kureka tugume nitureeba, tutasinda; <verse eid="1TH 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 5:7" />ahakuba abagwejegyera bagwejegyera nyekiro, n'abasinda basinda nyekiro; <verse eid="1TH 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 5:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 6:14-17">Efe 6:14-17</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 59:17">Isa 59:17</ref>. </char></note> kwonka itwe, nk'oku turi aba nyomushana, twerinde ebirikusinza, tujware okwikiriza na rukundo nk'eky'okwekingiza omu kufuba, kandi n'amatsiko g'okujunwa nk'enkofiira. <verse eid="1TH 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 5:9" />Mumanye ngu Ruhanga taratuteereireho kiniga kureka okutunga okujunwa ahabwa Mukama waitu Yesu Kristo, <verse eid="1TH 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 5:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 14:8">Rom 14:8</ref>, <ref loc="ROM 14:9">9</ref>. </char></note> owaatufeereire ngu tugume nawe, yaaba tuhuriire nari tugwejegyeire. <verse eid="1TH 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TH 5:11" />N'ahabw'ekyo mugumyane, kandi mwombekane, nk'oku murikukora.<verse eid="1TH 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Emitwarize y'Abakristaayo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TH 5:12" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:12: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1TI 5:17">1 Tim 5:17</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kwonka, nitubeeshengyereza, B'eishe-emwe, ku mumanya abo abarikubakoramu, abarikubategyeka omuri Mukama, bakabahabura, <verse eid="1TH 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TH 5:13" />mubahe ekitiinisa munonga omuri rukundo ahabw'omurimo gwabo. Mugume mwine obusingye, omuntu na mugyenzi we. <verse eid="1TH 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TH 5:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2TH 3:11">2 Tes 3:11</ref>, <ref loc="2TH 3:15">15</ref>. </char></note> Ahabw'okuba nitubeeshengyereza, B'eishe-emwe, muteise entahurira, mugumye abahahaire emitima, muramire abataine maani, mugumisiririze boona. <verse eid="1TH 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TH 5:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1PE 3:9">1 Pet 3:9</ref>. </char></note> Mwerinde hatagira omuntu weena omuriimwe owaihura ondiijo ekibi ahabw'ekibi, kureka obutoosha mwezirikire okukorerana gye, n'okukorera gye abandi boona. <verse eid="1TH 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TH 5:16" />Mugume mushemererwe ebiro byona, <verse eid="1TH 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TH 5:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 18:1">Luk 18:1</ref>. </char></note> mushabe obutoosha, <verse eid="1TH 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TH 5:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 5:20">Efe 5:20</ref>. </char></note> kandi omuri byona musiime; ahakuba nikyo Ruhanga arikubendeza omuri Kristo Yesu. <verse eid="1TH 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TH 5:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 14:1">1 Kor 14:1</ref>. </char></note> Mutaraaza Omwoyo; <verse eid="1TH 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TH 5:20" />mutagaya ebya baanabi; <verse eid="1TH 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1TH 5:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1JN 4:1">1 Yoh 4:1</ref>. </char></note> mugyeze byona; muhamire aha kirungi; <verse eid="1TH 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1TH 5:22" />mwetantare kyona ekirikushusha ekibi. <verse eid="1TH 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1TH 5:23" />Ruhanga mukama w'obusingye we wenka abeereze kimwe; kandi emyoyo yaanyu n'amagara gaanyu n'emibiri yaanyu birindwe gye, bishangwe bitaine ki birikuhanwa aha kiro ky'okwija kwa Mukama waitu Yesu Kristo. <verse eid="1TH 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1TH 5:24" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2TH 3:3">2 Tes 3:3</ref>. </char></note> Ogwo orikubeeta n'omwesigwa, kandi n'okukora niwe arikikora.<verse eid="1TH 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1TH 5:25" />B'eishe-emwe, mutushabire. <verse eid="1TH 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1TH 5:26" />Muramutsye ab'eishe-emwe boona n'okunywegyera okurikwera. <verse eid="1TH 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1TH 5:27" />Nimbarahiza Mukama mushomere ab'eishe-emwe boona ebaruha egi.<verse eid="1TH 5:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1TH 5:28" />Embabazi za Mukama waitu Yesu Kristo zigume naimwe.<verse eid="1TH 5:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 5" />
</usx>